    "alert_id": "ALERT_001",
    "title": "Overdue creatinine monitoring on TDF",
    "message": "Guidelines require serum creatinine monitoring for patients on TDF-based ART. The patient's last creatinine was 478 days before this visit, over 15 months ago. No creatinine was ordered at today's encounter. TDF can cause renal toxicity, and regular renal function monitoring is essential for early detection of nephrotoxicity. The clinician's plan of routine follow-up with no issues does not include renal monitoring.",
    "issue_type": "monitoring_gap",
    "severity": "moderate",
    "recommended_action": "Order serum creatinine and eGFR at this visit to assess TDF renal safety, and establish routine renal monitoring per guideline intervals.",
